  "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
  "instance_name": "minimization_of_racial_violence",
  "label": "The act of downplaying or justifying racially motivated violence",
  "description": "Minimization of racial violence refers to the act of downplaying or justifying racially motivated violence, often by implying that it is not a serious issue or that it does not warrant legal or moral condemnation. In the meme, the implication that killing zombies (non-human entities) is not homicide is used to minimize racially motivated violence. This requires understanding of the concept of minimizing racial violence and its role in promoting harmful ideologies.",
